  "abstract": "{\"id\":\"ad.landing_group.create\",\"title\":\"创建落地页组\",\"interface_path\":\"/open_api/2/tools/landing_group/create/\",\"method\":\"POST\",\"capability_summary\":\"用户可以通过此接口创建按照流量分配的落地页组，创建成功后返回\\\"code_0\\\"。需注意落地页组名称长度为1-20，橙子建站站点id列表的数量范围为2 \\u003c= site数量 \\u003c= 10。配合接口有【获取Access-Token】、【获取橙子建站站点列表】。\",\"related_docs\":[{\"id\":\"ad.access_token.get\",\"title\":\"获取Access-Token\",\"path\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1696710505596940\",\"relation\":\"前置接口\",\"reason\":\"创建落地页组需要授权access-token，获取方法见此接口文档\"},{\"id\":\"ad.orange_site_list.get\",\"title\":\"获取橙子建站站点列表\",\"path\":\"https://ad.oceanengine.com/openapi/doc/index.html?id=1696710620579852\",\"relation\":\"前置接口\",\"reason\":\"创建落地页组请求参数中的橙子建站站点id列表可通过此接口应答字段 `list` 获取\"}]}",
  "content": "<div class=\"qz-editor-engine am-engine\" data-element=\"root\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-O54R6hv9\">通过此接口，用户可以创建按照流量分配的落地页组，创建成功后，接口会返回\"code_0\"。<span style=\"color: #eb1010;\"></span></p><blockquote data-id=\"b603af74-i0Zgje1k\" style=\"margin-top: 5px; margin-bottom: 5px; padding-left: 1em; margin-left: 0px; border-left: 3px solid rgb(238, 238, 238); opacity: 0.6;\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-InxL2U2x\">落地页组信息会包括落地页组 ID、落地页组名称、落地页组 URL、落地页组状态、流量分配方式； 站点列表信息会包括成员 ID（即站点在落地页组中的唯一标识）、站点 ID、站点URL、站点启用状态、站点审核状态。</p></blockquote><p data-id=\"p838747a-cNsJzeB3\"><br/></p><div data-type=\"qzcard\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22borderColor%22%3A%22%23fed4a4%22%2C%22backgroundColor%22%3A%22%23fff5eb%22%2C%22text%22%3A%22%3Cul%20data-id%3D%5C%22u738a58b-dSf5MVgR%5C%22%3E%3Cli%20data-id%3D%5C%22ld70c578-vuYh9Quc%5C%22%3E%E8%90%BD%E5%9C%B0%E9%A1%B5%E7%BB%84%E5%90%8D%E7%A7%B0%E9%95%BF%E5%BA%A6%E4%B8%BA1-20%EF%BC%8C%E5%90%A6%E5%88%99%E6%97%A0%E6%B3%95%E5%88%9B%E5%BB%BA%E6%88%90%E5%8A%9F%EF%BC%81%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%20data-id%3D%5C%22ld70c578-dJjchhO3%5C%22%3E%E6%A9%99%E5%AD%90%E5%BB%BA%E7%AB%99%E7%AB%99%E7%82%B9id%E5%88%97%E8%A1%A8%E7%9A%84%E6%95%B0%E9%87%8F%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4%EF%BC%9A2%20%26lt%3B%3D%20site%E6%95%B0%E9%87%8F%20%26lt%3B%3D%2010%3C%2Fli%3E%3C%2Ful%3E%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22KI0Aw%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22block%22%2C%22html%22%3A%22%3Cul%20data-id%3D%5C%22u738a58b-dSf5MVgR%5C%22%3E%3Cli%20data-id%3D%5C%22ld70c578-vuYh9Quc%5C%22%3E%E8%90%BD%E5%9C%B0%E9%A1%B5%E7%BB%84%E5%90%8D%E7%A7%B0%E9%95%BF%E5%BA%A6%E4%B8%BA1-20%EF%BC%8C%E5%90%A6%E5%88%99%E6%97%A0%E6%B3%95%E5%88%9B%E5%BB%BA%E6%88%90%E5%8A%9F%EF%BC%81%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%20data-id%3D%5C%22ld70c578-dJjchhO3%5C%22%3E%E6%A9%99%E5%AD%90%E5%BB%BA%E7%AB%99%E7%AB%99%E7%82%B9id%E5%88%97%E8%A1%A8%E7%9A%84%E6%95%B0%E9%87%8F%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4%EF%BC%9A2%20%26lt%3B%3D%20site%E6%95%B0%E9%87%8F%20%26lt%3B%3D%2010%3C%2Fli%3E%3C%2Ful%3E%22%7D\"><div class=\"QZCard-container\" style=\"border-color: #fed4a4;background-color:#fff5eb;\"><div class=\"Q